    "summary": "A model equipped with **[[CLOSE-QUARTERS]](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters)** satisfies its unit’s weapon requirement for [Close-Quarters Shooting](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters-shooting). In other types of shooting, each model may fire from only one of its two sets, its **[[CLOSE-QUARTERS]](vsdata:core-rule/close-quarters)** weapons or its other ranged weapons. **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** models are exempt from this restriction.",
